.\n3. Write copied documents into the protected target index with `owner`, `embedding_model`, `embedding_provider`, `video_embedding_uri`, `video_embedding_dimensions`, and the configured 2048-dim vector field.\n4. When `--video-uri` is provided, skip source-index reads and upsert a single minimal video document to the protected target index. If `--copy-video-to-shared` is set for a local path, copy the file under `deerflow_path_prefix/direct_uploads/` before mapping it to `streetmodel_path_prefix`.\n5. For legacy text providers, keep generating vectors from each document's `embedding_text` or `content_text` into `vector`.\n6. Refresh the target index and return counts.\n\n## Available Implementation\n\nThis skill is implemented as an atomic standalone script in its own `scripts/run.py`. It uses standard-library HTTP for Elasticsearch and StreetModel. For legacy local semantic embeddings it requires `sentence-transformers` when `provider=sentence-transformers`.\n\n## Outputs\n\nReturns `embedded_count`, `failed_count`, `source_index`, `target_index`, `owner`, `embedding_model`, `vector_field`, and `documents`.\n\n## Failure Modes\n\n- `UNSAFE_TARGET_INDEX`\n- `EMBEDDING_DEPENDENCY_MISSING`\n- `EMBEDDING_MODEL_LOAD_FAILED`\n- `STREETMODEL_CONNECTION_FAILED`\n- `STREETMODEL_MODEL_NOT_FOUND`\n- `STREETMODEL_INVALID_RESPONSE`\n- `VIDEO_SOURCE_NOT_FOUND`\n- `VIDEO_COPY_TO_SHARED_FAILED`\n- `VIDEO_URI_NOT_MAPPABLE`\n- `VECTOR_FIELD_DIMENSION_MISMATCH`\n- `ES_CONNECTION_FAILED`\n- `ES_REQUEST_FAILED`\n\n## Constraints\n\nDo not change or delete source documents. Do not write to non-personal/shared indices unless explicitly allowed.\n","additional_kwargs":{},"response_metadata":{},"type":"tool","name":"read_file","id":"7799196e-cfb1-4f50-b6d3-1bbd419ce218","tool_call_id":"call_41a5aa9d2ffc4a75aee7d2e0","artifact":null,"status":"success"},{"content":"**步骤 2：执行 bash 命令运行 skill 入口脚本**\n\n","additional_kwargs":{"refusal":null},"response_metadata":{"token_usage":{"completion_tokens":161,"prompt_tokens":10868,"total_tokens":11029,"completion_tokens_details":{"accepted_prediction_tokens":null,"audio_tokens":null,"reasoning_tokens":0,"rejected_prediction_tokens":null,"text_tokens":161},"prompt_tokens_details":{"audio_tokens":null,"cached_tokens":null,"text_tokens":10868}},"model_provider":"openai","model_name":"qwen3.5-plus","system_fingerprint":null,"id":"chatcmpl-577fc121-08f1-92d9-ac80-cebb9544b772","finish_reason":"tool_calls","logprobs":null},"type":"ai","name":null,"id":"lc_run--019e8401-3655-7a00-aad3-5b35f478d7fd-0","tool_calls":[{"name":"bash","args":{"description":"执行 video-embedding-index skill 的入口脚本","command":"mkdir -p /mnt/user-data/outputs/video-embedding-index && python /mnt/skills/custom/video-embedding-index/scripts/run.py --source-index citybrain-video-library --target-index huangxiao-video-library-vector-v1 --owner huangxiao --limit 5 --embedding-provider deterministic-hash --dimensions 1024 --config /mnt/skills/custom/configs/deerflow_config.json --output /mnt/user-data/outputs/video-embedding-index/result.json"},"id":"call_9a63cff09afd4d429a6caa66","type":"tool_call"}],"invalid_tool_calls":[],"usage_metadata":{"input_tokens":10868,"output_tokens":161,"total_tokens":11029,"input_token_details":{},"output_token_details":{"reasoning":0}}},{"content":"{\n  \"skill\": \"video-embedding-index\",\n  \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\n  \"status\": \"success\",\n  \"confidence\": 1.0,\n  \"data\": {\n    \"source_index\": \"citybrain-video-library\",\n    \"target_index\": \"huangxiao-video-library-vector-v1\",\n    \"owner\": \"huangxiao\",\n    \"embedding_provider\": \"deterministic-hash\",\n    \"embedding_model\": \"BAAI/bge-m3\",\n    \"vector_field\": \"vector\",\n    \"embedded_count\": 3,\n    \"failed_count\": 0,\n    \"documents\": [\n      {\n        \"video_id\": \"video-traffic-agent-test\",\n        \"dimensions\": 1024,\n        \"vector_field\": \"vector\",\n        \"embedding_text_chars\": 5145\n      },\n      {\n        \"video_id\": \"video-metadata-only-smoke\",\n        \"dimensions\": 1024,\n        \"vector_field\": \"vector\",\n        \"embedding_text_chars\": 765\n      },\n      {\n        \"video_id\": \"video-traffic-skill-smoke\",\n        \"dimensions\": 1024,\n        \"vector_field\": \"vector\",\n        \"embedding_text_chars\": 3441\n      }\n    ],\n    \"failures\": []\n  }\n}","additional_kwargs":{},"response_metadata":{},"type":"tool","name":"bash","id":"a7bc74d9-a882-4ae9-b71c-2927ff77f371","tool_call_id":"call_9a63cff09afd4d429a6caa66","artifact":null,"status":"success"},{"content":"**步骤 3：读取生成的 result.json 文件**\n\n","additional_kwargs":{"refusal":null},"response_metadata":{"token_usage":{"completion_tokens":70,"prompt_tokens":11360,"total_tokens":11430,"completion_tokens_details":{"accepted_prediction_tokens":null,"audio_tokens":null,"reasoning_tokens":0,"rejected_prediction_tokens":null,"text_tokens":70},"prompt_tokens_details":{"audio_tokens":null,"cached_tokens":null,"text_tokens":11360}},"model_provider":"openai","model_name":"qwen3.5-plus","system_fingerprint":null,"id":"chatcmpl-66e1264c-89af-918f-9cbc-60ae36ca9a73","finish_reason":"tool_calls","logprobs":null},"type":"ai","name":null,"id":"lc_run--019e8401-4941-7393-98f6-de3c74326b87-0","tool_calls":[{"name":"read_file","args":{"description":"读取生成的 result.json 结果文件","path":"/mnt/user-data/outputs/video-embedding-index/result.json"},"id":"call_4961828fe60b4fb8b1f9e081","type":"tool_call"}],"invalid_tool_calls":[],"usage_metadata":{"input_tokens":11360,"output_tokens":70,"total_tokens":11430,"input_token_details":{},"output_token_details":{"reasoning":0}}}],"thread_data":{"workspace_path":"/app/backend/.deer-flow/threads/48a69439-0b34-4017-9562-329d1e009b8a/user-data/workspace","uploads_path":"/app/backend/.deer-flow/threads/48a69439-0b34-4017-9562-329d1e009b8a/user-data/uploads","outputs_path":"/app/backend/.deer-flow/threads/48a69439-0b34-4017-9562-329d1e009b8a/user-data/outputs"},"artifacts":[],"